  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Institut Pasteur de Dakar</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To accelerate the development of essential new tools and approaches to mitigate the direct and indirect impacts of outbreak diseases in vulnerable countries through: international and LMIC-led partnerships for research and product development; pooled funds for responsive emergency platforms and flexible research grant mechanisms; and a research facility for evidence synthesis and rapid response (to be integrated with the Science for Emergencies Centre of Expertise).</narrative>
  </description>
